<%@ page language="java" contentType="text/html; charset=UTF-8" pageEncoding="UTF-8" %><%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" %>
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Dr.Her 계정</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="<c:url value='/css/ui.css'/>"></head><body><main class="Tiles_wrap"><h1>Dr.Her 계정</h1><nav><a href="<c:url value='/main'/>">병원 찾기</a> · <a href="<c:url value='/member/loginForm'/>">로그인</a> · <a href="<c:url value='/member/register'/>">회원가입</a> · <a href="<c:url value='/member/resetForm'/>">비밀번호 재설정</a></nav><p role="status"><c:out value="${msg}"/></p><c:choose><c:when test="${authMode == 'register'}"><h2>회원가입</h2><form method="post" action="<c:url value='/member/register'/>"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="${sessionScope.CSRF}"><label>아이디 (이메일 사용 가능)<input name="ID" required minlength="3" maxlength="100" autocomplete="username"></label><label>비밀번호<input name="PWD" type="password" required minlength="10" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password"></label><label>이름<input name="NAME" required maxlength="100"></label><label>전화번호<input name="PHONE" maxlength="30"></label><label>주소<input name="ADDR" maxlength="500"></label><input type="hidden" name="ADDR_GPS" value="37.5665,126.9780"><input type="hidden" name="MMS_CHK" value="N"><button>회원가입</button></form></c:when><c:when test="${authMode == 'reset'}"><h2>재설정 링크 요청</h2><form method="post" action="<c:url value='/member/sendMail'/>"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="${sessionScope.CSRF}"><label>가입 아이디<input name="ID" required></label><button>링크 요청</button></form><p>로컬 환경에서는 설정된 합성 메일함에만 링크를 생성합니다. 실제 메일 공급자가 없으면 오류를 표시합니다.</p><h2>새 비밀번호</h2><form method="post" action="<c:url value='/member/newPWD'/>"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="${sessionScope.CSRF}"><label>일회용 토큰<input name="TOKEN" required></label><label>새 비밀번호<input name="PWD" type="password" required minlength="10" maxlength="128"></label><button>비밀번호 변경</button></form></c:when><c:otherwise><h2>로그인</h2><form method="post" action="<c:url value='/member/login'/>"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="${sessionScope.CSRF}"><label>아이디<input name="ID" required autocomplete="username"></label><label>비밀번호<input name="PWD" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><button>로그인</button></form><p>외부 로그인 공급자는 별도 검증된 설정이 필요합니다.</p></c:otherwise></c:choose></main></body></html>
